evenExtModule -- even part of Ext^*(M,k) over a complete intersection as module over CI operator ring
*****************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        E = evenExtModule M
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, over a complete intersection
