|o10 = {1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1}                                  |
|                                                          |
|o10 : List                                                |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : Eodd = oddExtModule(M1)                             |
|                                                          |
|              1                                           |
|o11 = (kk[X ])                                            |
|           0                                              |
|                                                          |
|o11 : kk[X ]-module, free                                 |
|          0                                               |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : apply(toList(0..5), i->hilbertFunction(i, Eodd))    |
