infiniteBettiNumbers -- betti numbers of finite resolution computed from a matrix factorization
***********************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        L = finiteBettiNumbers (MF,len)
  * Inputs:
      * MF, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, List of HashTables as computed
        by "matrixFactorization"
      * len, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, length of betti number
        sequence to produce
  * Outputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, List of betti numbers

Description
===========

Uses the ranks of the B matrices in a matrix factorization for a module M over
S/(f_1,..,f_c) to compute the betti numbers of the minimal resolution of M over
R, which is the sum of the divided power algebras on c-j+1 variables tensored
with B(j).

+--------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : setRandomSeed 0                              |
| -- setting random seed to 0                      |
|                                                  |
|o1 = 0                                            |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : kk = ZZ/101                                  |
|                                                  |
|o2 = kk                                           |
|                                                  |
|o2 : QuotientRing                                 |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : S = kk[a,b,u,v]                              |
|                                                  |
|o3 = S                                            |
|                                                  |
|o3 : PolynomialRing                               |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : ff = matrix"au,bv"                           |
|                                                  |
|o4 = | au bv |                                    |
|                                                  |
|             1      2                             |
|o4 : Matrix S  <-- S                              |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : R = S/ideal ff                               |
|                                                  |
|o5 = R                                            |
|                                                  |
|o5 : QuotientRing                                 |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : M0 = R^1/ideal"a,b"                          |
|                                                  |
|o6 = cokernel | a b |                             |
|                                                  |
|                            1                     |
|o6 : R-module, quotient of R                      |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : F = freeResolution(M0, LengthLimit =>3)      |
|                                                  |
|      1      2      3      4                      |
|o7 = R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R                       |
|                                                  |
|     0      1      2      3                       |
|                                                  |
|o7 : Complex                                      |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : M = coker F.dd_3;                            |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : MF = matrixFactorization(ff,M);              |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : betti freeResolution pushForward(map(R,S),M)|
|                                                  |
|             0 1 2                                |
|o10 = total: 3 5 2                                |
|          2: 3 4 .                                |
|          3: . 1 2                                |
|                                                  |
|o10 : BettiTally                                  |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : finiteBettiNumbers MF                       |
|                                                  |
|o11 = {3, 5, 2}                                   |
|                                                  |
|o11 : List                                        |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : infiniteBettiNumbers(MF,5)                  |
|                                                  |
|o12 = {3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8}                          |
|                                                  |
|o12 : List                                        |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : betti freeResolution (M, LengthLimit => 5)  |
|                                                  |
|             0 1 2 3 4 5                          |
|o13 = total: 3 4 5 6 7 8                          |
|          2: 3 4 5 6 7 8                          |
|                                                  |
|o13 : BettiTally                                  |
+--------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

