isQuasiRegular -- tests a matrix or sequence or list for quasi-regularity on a module
*************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        t = isQuasiRegular(ff,M)
  * Inputs:
      * ff, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, 
      * ff, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 
      * ff, a *note sequence: (Macaulay2Doc)Sequence,, 
      * M, a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, 
  * Outputs:
      * t, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, 

Description
===========

ff is quasi-regular if the length of ff is <= dim M and the annihilator of ff_i
on M/(ff_0..ff_{(i-1))}M has finite length for all i=0..(length ff)-1.

+-----------------------------------------+
|i1 : kk=ZZ/101;                          |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i2 : S = kk[a,b,c];                      |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i3 : E = S^1/ideal"ab"++S^1/ideal vars S;|
+-----------------------------------------+
|i4 : f1 =matrix"a";                      |
|                                         |
|             1      1                    |
|o4 : Matrix S  <-- S                     |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i5 : f2 =matrix"a+b,c";                  |
|                                         |
|             1      2                    |
|o5 : Matrix S  <-- S                     |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i6 : f3 = matrix"a+b";                   |
|                                         |
|             1      1                    |
|o6 : Matrix S  <-- S                     |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i7 : f4 = matrix"a+b, a2+b";             |
|                                         |
|             1      2                    |
|o7 : Matrix S  <-- S                     |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i8 : isQuasiRegular(f1,E)                |
|                                         |
|o8 = false                               |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i9 : isQuasiRegular(f2,E)                |
|                                         |
|o9 = true                                |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i10 : isQuasiRegular(f3,E)               |
|                                         |
|o10 = true                               |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i11 : isQuasiRegular(f4,E)               |
|                                         |
|o11 = false                              |
+-----------------------------------------+

