koszulExtension -- creates the Koszul extension complex of a map
****************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        MM = koszulExtension(FF,BB,psi1,ff)
  * Inputs:
      * FF, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, resolution over S
      * BB, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, two-term complex BB_1-->BB_0
      * psi1, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, from BB_1 to FF_0
      * ff, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, regular sequence
        annihilating the module resolved by FF
  * Outputs:
      * MM, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, the mapping cone of the
        induced map B[-1]\otimes KK(ff) to W extending psi

Description
===========

Implements the construction in the paper "Matrix Factorizations in Higher
Codimension" by Eisenbud and Peeva.

