Layered -- Option for matrixFactorization
*****************************************

  * Usage: 
        matrixFactorization(ff,m,Layered => true)
  * Inputs:
      * Check, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, 

Description
===========

Makes matrixFactorization use the "layered" algorithm, which works for any MCM
module, but returns something non-minimal if the module is not a "high syzygy"
in a suitable sense. Default is "true". Note that when the module is a high
syzygy, Layered=> false is much faster.

