|i4 : M = coker matrix"x,y,z;y,z,x";                 |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : betti (F = freeResolution(M, LengthLimit => 3))|
|                                                    |
|            0 1 2 3                                 |
|o5 = total: 2 3 5 6                                 |
|         0: 2 3 . .                                 |
|         1: . . 5 6                                 |
|                                                    |
|o5 : BettiTally                                     |
