oddExtModule -- odd part of Ext^*(M,k) over a complete intersection as module over CI operator ring
***************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        E = oddExtModule M
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, over a complete intersection
        ring
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * OutRing => ..., default value 0
  * Outputs:
      * E, a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, over a polynomial ring with
        gens in degree 1

Description
===========

Extracts the odd degree part from ExtModule M. If the optional argument OutRing
=> T is given, and class T === PolynomialRing, then the output will be a module
over T.

