|                                                    |
|o2 = R                                              |
|                                                    |
|o2 : QuotientRing                                   |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : M = R^1/ideal(x,y,z)                           |
|                                                    |
|o3 = cokernel | x y z |                             |
|                                                    |
|                            1                       |
|o3 : R-module, quotient of R                        |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : F = freeResolution(M, LengthLimit => 4)        |
|                                                    |
|      1      3      5      7      9                 |
|o4 = R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R                  |
|                                                    |
|     0      1      2      3      4                  |
|                                                    |
|o4 : Complex                                        |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : ff = matrix{{z^3}}                             |
|                                                    |
|o5 = | z3 |                                         |
|                                                    |
|             1      1                               |
|o5 : Matrix R  <-- R                                |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : R1 = R/ideal ff                                |
|                                                    |
|o6 = R1                                             |
|                                                    |
|o6 : QuotientRing                                   |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : betti F                                        |
|                                                    |
|            0 1 2 3 4                               |
|o7 = total: 1 3 5 7 9                               |
|         0: 1 3 3 1 .                               |
|         1: . . 2 6 6                               |
