splittings -- compute the splittings of a split right exact sequence
********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        x = splittings(a,b)
  * Inputs:
      * a, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, maps into the kernel of b
      * b, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, representing a surjection
        from target a to a free module
  * Outputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, L = \{sigma,tau\}, splittings of
        a,b respectively

Description
===========

Assuming that (a,b) are the maps of a right exact sequence

$0\to A\to B\to C \to 0$

with B, C free, the script produces a pair of maps sigma, tau with $tau: C \to
B$ a splitting of b and $sigma: B \to A$ a splitting of a; that is,

$a*sigma+tau*b = 1_B$

$sigma*a = 1_A$

$b*tau = 1_C$

+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : kk= ZZ/101                                                           |
|                                                                          |
|o1 = kk                                                                   |
|                                                                          |
|o1 : QuotientRing                                                         |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : S = kk[x,y,z]                                                        |
|                                                                          |
|o2 = S                                                                    |
|                                                                          |
|o2 : PolynomialRing                                                       |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : setRandomSeed 0                                                      |
| -- setting random seed to 0                                              |
|                                                                          |
|o3 = 0                                                                    |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : t = random(S^{2:-1,2:-2}, S^{3:-1,4:-2})                             |
|                                                                          |
|o4 = {1} | 24  -36 -30 39x-43y+45z  21x-15y-34z 34x-28y-48z  19x-47y-47z ||
