tensorWithComponents -- forms the tensor product, preserving direct sum information
***********************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        T = tensor(M,N)
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, 
      * N, a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, 
  * Outputs:
      * T, a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, 

Description
===========

If M and/or N are direct sum modules (isDirectSum M == true) then T is the
direct sum of the tensor products between the components. This SHOULD be built
into M**N, but isn't as of M2, v. 1.7

See also
========

  * *note HomWithComponents: HomWithComponents, -- computes Hom, preserving
    direct sum information
  * *note dualWithComponents: dualWithComponents, -- dual module preserving
    direct sum information

